The '''Oubliette''' is a sub-location of the {{zone|Stillgore Château}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. It is based on an area of the {{zone|Ruins}}.

== Purpose ==
The entrance of the '''Oubliette''' is closed off, and the area in front of it is filled with {{MobSprite|Oubliette Guard}}s. Once all guards have been killed, the entrance will open, and the player can leave. Once the door opens, a message will appear in chat, saying:{{TextSection|boxed=true|text={{Dialogue|All the guards have been defeated, you are free to go!}}}}

